WEBVTT

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:11.400
I have an announcement to make, dear sisters.

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.940
What are you about to start,

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.870
Rosa Chinensis en bouton?

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:19.240
Introduce yourself.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:22.950
I'm Fukuzawa Yumi of Year 1, Peach Class.

00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.920
I see. Fukuzawa Yumi-san.

00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:27.720
How is that written in kanji?

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:30.430
"Fukuzawa," as in Yukichi Fukuzawa.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:32.830
"Yu" is the " shimesu" radical with " right."

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:34.950
And the "mi" is the " mi"
for the Year of the Snake.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.490
What a nice auspicious sounding name.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.230
So?

00:00:44.470 --> 00:00:47.030
What of this Fukuzawa Yumi-san?

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:51.210
Dear sisters, don't you think
it rude to stare at her so?

00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.040
Look, you have completely frightened Yumi.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.210
A forest of briars...

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.950
Red, white, and yellow.
Surrounded by the three Lady Roses.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:08.060
Rosa Foetida, let us first hear
what Sachiko has to say.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.060
Agreed, Rosa Chinensis.

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:16.030
I shall fulfill the promise I made earlier.

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.510
I choose Yumi.

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.180
Are you serious?

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.150
Of course.

00:01:25.580 --> 00:01:30.680
I hereby declare that I shall make
Yumi Fukuzawa my petite soeur.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:36.860
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:41.660
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:47.960
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:52.210
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:55.680
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:58.940
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:04.640
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:17.060
Maria Watches Over Us

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:39.870
The Troubling Declaration
of Sisterhood

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:45.090
Me? Rosa Chinensis en bouton's petite soeur?

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.920
Me, become the little sister
of the Red Rose's rosebud?

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:53.120
It all began this morning.

00:04:11.710 --> 00:04:12.540
One moment.

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.920
Um, were you addressing me?

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.020
Yes, I am the one that spoke,
and I was addressing you.

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.220
There is no mistake.

00:04:27.000 --> 00:04:28.120
Hold this.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:29.260
Oh...

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.690
Your scarf is crooked.

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.460
You should always keep your appearance neat.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:42.330
Maria-sama is watching you.

00:04:44.410 --> 00:04:45.440
Goodbye.

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.870
G-Goodbye! T-Thank you very much!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:05:02.460
The Red Rose's rosebud...
Rosa Chinensis en bouton!

00:05:05.330 --> 00:05:06.960
Oh, is that all?

00:05:07.900 --> 00:05:09.770
That was so careless of me.

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:10.930
Forget about it.

00:05:11.070 --> 00:05:12.800
Then there'll be no problem.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:13.940
Why?

00:05:14.080 --> 00:05:18.140
Ogasawara Sachiko-sama is the
star of Lillian Girls' Academy.

00:05:19.010 --> 00:05:20.950
A star won't remember...

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:22.920
...every encounter she has
with ordinary students.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:28.420
Did you hear?

00:05:29.220 --> 00:05:32.990
About how Shimako-san became
Rosa Gigantea en bouton, right?

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:34.890
Chosen over all the second year students.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:39.330
Not that. Shimako-san supposedly had
an offer, not only from Rosa Gigantea,

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:41.890
but from Sachiko-sama as well.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:42.800
What?!

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:45.170
Sachiko-sama had asked her first,

00:05:45.170 --> 00:05:48.940
but she apparently accepted
the rosary from Rosa Gigantea.

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:51.910
Meaning Sachiko-sama was rejected.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.650
In the high school division
at Lillian Girls' Academy,

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:57.450
there is a system of "soeurs."

00:05:58.450 --> 00:06:00.940
"Soeurs" means " sisters" in French.

00:06:01.790 --> 00:06:04.290
Just like how a big sister
guides her little sister,

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.990
through this system of upperclassmen
counseling underclassmen,

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:09.330
a pure and righteous academic
lifestyle has been passed down...

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:12.390
...without the need for particularly
strict school regulations.

00:06:14.770 --> 00:06:18.710
Sachiko-sama is famous for her
dislike of sloppy appearances.

00:06:18.910 --> 00:06:22.240
But maybe it's a good thing that you
don't have an Onee-sama, Yumi-san.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:23.610
Huh? What do you mean?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:25.450
There was a first-year student...

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:27.880
...who walked in front of Sachiko-sama
with her scarf untied on purpose.

00:06:27.880 --> 00:06:29.780
She was not only given the cold shoulder,

00:06:29.780 --> 00:06:32.280
but her Onee-sama was admonished for it, too!

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:36.250
Yumi-san! Yumi-san!

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:40.190
Tsutako-san! Are you done
cleaning the classroom already?

00:06:40.260 --> 00:06:43.990
Yes, which is why I hurried over here,
so I wouldn't miss you.

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:45.690
Is there something I can help you with?

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.970
Yumi-san, we have club activities to
attend to, so we'll excuse ourselves.

00:06:50.570 --> 00:06:53.230
I'll return the Cleaning
Logbook to the faculty office.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:59.940
You're aware that I belong to the
Photography Club, aren't you?

00:07:00.110 --> 00:07:01.480
Y-Yes...

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:04.420
I guess it's true that you keep your
camera with you at all times,

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:05.220
except during class.

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:11.250
I always obtain the consent of my
subjects before I release my photos.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:12.980
Like this...

00:07:20.330 --> 00:07:22.840
Incidentally, the title is "Discipline."

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.300
C-Could I have this?!

00:07:25.440 --> 00:07:27.140
I thought you'd say that.

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:27.800
What?

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:29.300
I know.

00:07:30.810 --> 00:07:33.800
That you secretly admire Sachiko-sama.

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.840
I won't mind giving you a copy,
but on two small conditions.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.250
Conditions?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:44.390
One, you'll let me display it at the
school festival in the exhibition corner...

00:07:44.390 --> 00:07:45.860
...of the Photography Club.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:48.350
Tsutako-san, you must be joking.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:50.560
I assure you, this is no joke.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.290
The second condition...

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:55.700
...is to receive permission from
Rosa Chinensis en bouton.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.200
From Sachiko-sama?!

00:07:57.570 --> 00:07:59.940
Tsutako-san, you could
negotiate with her yourself.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.500
Even I, Tsutako-san, find the officers
of the Yamayuri Council terrifying.

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:05.340
It would be even more impossible for me.

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:06.510
Why?

00:08:07.110 --> 00:08:09.520
Sachiko-sama is not someone
who concerns herself...

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.820
...with the uniform scarf
of a mere underclassman.

00:08:11.820 --> 00:08:15.590
And yet, this morning,
she retied yours with her own hands.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:16.280
That's extraordinary!

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:19.490
Even if they don't know it themselves,

00:08:19.490 --> 00:08:20.900
people who are drawn to one another...

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:23.330
...tend to involuntarily come
together, don't you think?

00:08:24.470 --> 00:08:25.060
Look.

00:08:25.730 --> 00:08:27.330
It's as if you're soeurs.

00:08:31.610 --> 00:08:34.940
Do you suppose Sachiko-sama is really here?

00:08:35.710 --> 00:08:37.910
The word is that the officers
of the Yamayuri Council...

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.380
...gather at the Rose Mansion
every day after classes...

00:08:40.380 --> 00:08:42.910
...in preparation for the school festival.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:47.190
Do you have some business
with the Yamayuri Council?

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:51.620
Shimako-san! Why are you here?

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.800
Shimako-san is Rosa Gigantea en bouton,

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.490
so it's natural for her to be here.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:08:58.900
You came at the perfect time.

00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.460
Shimako-san, won't you please announce us?

00:09:01.770 --> 00:09:05.210
Yumi-san and I would like to speak
with Rosa Chinensis en bouton.

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:08.480
Sachiko-sama is probably upstairs.

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:10.170
Why don't you come in?

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.250
This way.

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:19.420
The Yamayuri Council...

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:21.980
...is what you would call the
Student Council at a normal school.

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.920
Its formal member officers are limited to,

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:30.500
Rosa Chinensis, Rosa Foetida, and Rosa
Gigantea, the three Lady Roses.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.300
The younger sisters of the Lady Roses,

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:35.790
such as Sachiko-sama and Shimako-san,
are called "boutons,"

00:09:36.170 --> 00:09:39.440
and they are acknowledged by
everyone as the next Roses to bloom.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.040
Meeting in Progress
Please Be Quiet
Yamayuri Council

00:09:46.210 --> 00:09:47.010
This is so arbitrary!

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.050
You are being mean, dear sisters!

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:52.150
It seems Sachiko-sama is here.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:54.320
Then, the person we just heard was...

00:09:54.460 --> 00:09:55.750
This happens all the time.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:06.260
Here you are.

00:10:06.770 --> 00:10:07.530
Oh...

00:10:08.370 --> 00:10:09.530
Would you like any sugar or cream?

00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.200
Shimazu Yoshino-san.

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.430
The petite soeur of
Rosa Foetida en bouton.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:18.800
No, thank you.

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:30.720
Yumi-san.

00:10:32.090 --> 00:10:32.960
Y-Yes?

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:34.700
If you would like,

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.100
please feel free to visit the Rose
Mansion whenever you wish.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:40.830
After all, you are now Sachiko's soeur.

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:44.000
And you are a precious fellow
member to us now as well.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:48.440
Rosa Chinensis, do you mean to
acknowledge Sachiko's assertion?

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:51.950
Rosa Foetida, if Sachiko
has made up her mind,

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:55.070
we are no longer at a stage where
it is our place to object, are we?

00:10:55.350 --> 00:10:56.250
Uh, um...

00:10:56.680 --> 00:10:58.280
You stay quiet.

00:10:58.690 --> 00:11:01.850
We won't be able to draw any conclusions
for a while, don't you think?

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.620
At the very least,

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:07.460
not while one of the main players
here is looking so bewildered.

00:11:08.030 --> 00:11:10.760
You are right, Rosa Gigantea.

00:11:15.470 --> 00:11:18.910
Maria Watches Over Us

00:11:22.780 --> 00:11:23.330
Here!

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:25.140
What is it, Takeshima Tsutako-san?

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:28.870
I'm honored that you know
who I am, Rosa Gigantea.

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:33.150
Yumi-san is one thing, but every
student at the academy knows you.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:37.450
Pardon me, but I don't understand
what is going on at all.

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:40.890
Yes, it would be rude of us not to explain.

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.460
There is no need for an explanation.

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:45.990
I have chosen my soeur.

00:11:46.270 --> 00:11:47.890
That's all there is to it.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.370
We can end the meeting for today.

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.400
What are you doing,
saying whatever you please?

00:11:51.740 --> 00:11:54.040
If you wish for the meeting to end,
you may go alone.

00:11:54.380 --> 00:11:56.470
Leaving Yumi-san here, of course.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.280
The truth is...

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:04.150
According to Rosa Chinensis,

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:05.950
for this year's school festival,

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:08.260
the Yamayuri Council has settled on putting on...

00:12:08.260 --> 00:12:10.450
...a performance of Cinderella,
starring Sachiko-sama.

00:12:10.760 --> 00:12:13.990
There was no problem with that in and of itself,

00:12:14.600 --> 00:12:17.330
but Sachiko-sama had thought that the prince...

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:21.530
...would be played by Rosa Foetida
en bouton, Hasekura Rei-sama.

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:26.330
Oh, I'd heard from the start
that I was the understudy.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:30.940
On the same hill as Lillian is a boys'
school called Hanadera Academy...

00:12:31.350 --> 00:12:33.980
...and the Student Body President of Hanadera...

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:35.780
...was actually to play the Prince.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:40.080
So you decided this when I wasn't present.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:43.690
Because on the days we
had meetings with Hanadera,

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.850
you were always wriggling your way out of them.

00:12:46.260 --> 00:12:49.390
This is what happens when you
don't rein in your dislike of men.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:54.870
Uh, but how is Sachiko-sama's
unwillingness to play Cinderella...

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.670
...related to making Yumi-san her little sister?

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:02.100
That was because Sachiko-sama
does not have a little sister...

00:13:02.210 --> 00:13:04.350
...and the Lady Roses said
someone incapable of...

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.640
...even finding a petite soeur would
not have a say in the matter.

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:09.340
So, I just have to go find
one this instant, right?!

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:22.460
That was not to say that...

00:13:22.460 --> 00:13:25.830
...we expected her to make just
anyone her petite soeur.

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:26.970
To think she would grab...

00:13:26.970 --> 00:13:29.940
...the very first underclassman
she ran into outside the room...

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:31.430
...and make the girl her soeur...

00:13:31.810 --> 00:13:33.710
This isn't "The Straw Millionaire."

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.400
Are you all right?

00:13:35.510 --> 00:13:38.100
Yes, I just fell on my bottom.

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.300
Thank goodness.

00:13:39.480 --> 00:13:42.180
By the way, you're a
first-year student, aren't you?

00:13:42.450 --> 00:13:43.750
Do you have an Onee-sama?

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:45.990
No, I don't, but...

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:46.750
Very well.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:48.160
In other words,

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:51.230
Sachiko-sama made me, someone she
had met only today, her petite soeur,

00:13:51.230 --> 00:13:53.990
all because she wants to be excused
from the role of Cinderella.

00:13:54.460 --> 00:13:57.760
And as for the reason she wants
to be excused from the role...

00:13:58.270 --> 00:13:59.460
You're interesting.

00:13:59.600 --> 00:14:00.260
Huh?

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.770
You were making a bunch of funny faces.

00:14:03.640 --> 00:14:04.190
What?

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:07.240
There's an unpredictability to you. I approve.

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:12.070
At any rate, we cannot
acknowledge such a relationship.

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:14.150
As your grande soeur,

00:14:14.150 --> 00:14:16.170
this will bring my character
into question as well.

00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:19.150
I shall look after Yumi every step of the way.

00:14:19.350 --> 00:14:22.720
I shall educate her and raise her to
become a respectable Red Rose.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.520
Quit speaking on the spur of the moment.

00:14:25.660 --> 00:14:29.200
The truth is, you didn't even know
Yumi-san's name until just now, did you?

00:14:29.200 --> 00:14:29.930
That is...

00:14:29.930 --> 00:14:30.950
Please wait.

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:36.230
I believe this was not the first
time these two have met.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:41.230
After all, Yumi-san came
here to see Sachiko-sama.

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:43.800
Is this true?

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:45.900
Yes...

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:47.510
We even have proof.

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:49.110
T-Tsutako-san...

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:51.350
I see.

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:54.280
So the two were previously acquainted.

00:14:56.160 --> 00:14:57.620
You have our apology for that.
You have our apology for that.

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.020
When... did we meet?

00:15:01.530 --> 00:15:03.930
She doesn't even remember
what happened this morning!

00:15:04.060 --> 00:15:06.160
I believe you can tell by looking at this,

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:09.660
but Yumi and I are quite close.

00:15:10.670 --> 00:15:11.500
Very well.

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:13.870
You have my approval.

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:15.470
Onee-sama!

00:15:15.640 --> 00:15:16.370
However,

00:15:17.340 --> 00:15:20.250
that is not to say you have my
approval to step down as Cinderella.

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:22.080
What of the promise?

00:15:22.080 --> 00:15:24.740
That was something you were
going on about on your own.

00:15:24.950 --> 00:15:26.950
If we were to change roles at this late date,

00:15:26.950 --> 00:15:28.620
what would become of the school festival?

00:15:30.260 --> 00:15:32.750
You are the next Rosa Chinensis.

00:15:33.030 --> 00:15:34.890
You must be fully aware of the consequences.

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:37.800
I am going home.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:38.290
Wait.

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:40.700
Let me confirm one thing.

00:15:41.400 --> 00:15:42.800
What is Yumi-san to you?

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:46.570
Do you still think of Yumi-san
as your soeur even now?

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:49.200
Of course! Yumi is my little sister!

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.310
Onee-sama, do you mean to insult me?

00:15:53.750 --> 00:15:58.050
You make it sound as if I made
Yumi my soeur merely to use her.

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.180
S-She didn't?

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:01.120
Good.

00:16:01.460 --> 00:16:03.460
If you had abandoned Yumi-san now,

00:16:03.460 --> 00:16:07.890
I would have had to sever my ties
of sisterhood with you as well.

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:09.960
Have you already given her your rosary?

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.360
Not yet.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:12.570
Though, if you wish,

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:15.730
I would not mind performing the
ceremony before all of you here.

00:16:16.540 --> 00:16:18.030
That might be nice.

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:22.270
Um...

00:16:22.640 --> 00:16:24.110
Don't move, Yumi.

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:31.250
Am I okay with this?

00:16:31.820 --> 00:16:34.980
Am I really okay with
becoming her soeur like this?

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:39.520
Um...

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.180
Please wait.

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.730
Sachiko-sama, dear sisters,

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.060
haven't you forgotten something important?

00:16:48.300 --> 00:16:49.740
Yumi-san's feelings.

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:53.970
You think she might not accept the rosary?

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:56.410
I would not presume to say that,

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:59.880
but I believe it only proper to ask her
what her feelings are on the matter.

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:00.710
I see.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:04.540
Even if it is an offer made by
Rosa Chinensis en bouton,

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:08.880
there is no knowing if she
might decline as Shimako did.

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:12.580
But Yumi-san is one of Sachiko-san's admirers.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:14.090
I think so, too.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:18.160
Watching her, I immediately figured out
that she was a fan of Sachiko's.

00:17:18.870 --> 00:17:21.200
But shall we ask as a formality?

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:23.260
After all, there is the rare possibility.

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:27.540
It seems Sachiko wishes to
make you her petite soeur,

00:17:27.840 --> 00:17:31.240
but are you inclined to accept Sachiko's rosary?

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.410
I am very sorry.

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:45.020
I just cannot become your soeur, Sachiko-sama.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:50.030
Why? I have the right...

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:53.390
...to at least ask that, don't I?

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:58.200
Have you grown to hate Sachiko,
now that you've seen her true colors?

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:00.900
Hate her?! It's not like that...

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:04.210
I can't explain it very well, but...

00:18:04.550 --> 00:18:05.810
Just because I'm a fan of hers...

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:08.340
...doesn't necessarily mean that I want...

00:18:08.520 --> 00:18:10.880
...to become her little sister...

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:13.280
Precisely because I am a fan,

00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:16.480
I have my own pride as a fan, so...

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:20.590
Either way, you've been rejected yet again.

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:23.390
This year's first-year students
are something else.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.600
Poor Sachiko.

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:27.820
A shocking second defeat in a row.

00:18:27.900 --> 00:18:29.940
If you feel sorry for me,

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:33.030
won't you please do something
about the Cinderella matter?

00:18:33.140 --> 00:18:33.970
Um...

00:18:34.740 --> 00:18:35.770
Oh, you...

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:37.440
You were still here?

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:41.180
Um, would it be possible to
ask the people of Hanadera...

00:18:41.180 --> 00:18:43.480
...and have them withdraw from
the production this one time?

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:47.450
Do you mean to try to save Sachiko
after all that's happened?

00:18:47.750 --> 00:18:49.760
I mean, all of you share some responsibility...

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.060
...in that Sachiko-sama
was not properly informed...

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:53.030
Be quiet!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:01.930
I know that you are saying this for my sake.

00:19:02.100 --> 00:19:04.660
But please don't blame our dear sisters.

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:09.270
You're right...

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:13.580
Just forcing her to dance with
a boy against her will would be...

00:19:13.580 --> 00:19:17.680
If we force underclassmen to do things
that they don't find reasonable,

00:19:17.680 --> 00:19:20.350
we cannot lead the Student Council.

00:19:20.790 --> 00:19:23.390
But making changes at this late date would be...

00:19:23.390 --> 00:19:25.190
Let's make a bet.

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:29.430
If we tell her to play Cinderella
without letting her have a say,

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:32.160
just as Yumi says, it isn't fair.

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.630
So how about we give Sachiko a chance...

00:19:34.870 --> 00:19:37.460
...and have her agree to
play a game with penalties?

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:40.840
And if I win this?

00:19:40.840 --> 00:19:42.540
You can step down from the role of Cinderella.

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:44.240
This time, it's a promise.

00:19:45.150 --> 00:19:46.340
I understand.

00:19:46.550 --> 00:19:48.210
So? What is this bet?

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:52.250
Whether you can make
Yumi-san your soeur or not.

00:19:53.450 --> 00:19:55.610
The deadline is the day
before the school festival.

00:19:55.920 --> 00:19:58.890
Making someone accept your rosary
when she's already declined you once...

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:00.420
...will be a nearly impossible feat.

00:20:00.630 --> 00:20:02.650
Oh, yes, and one other thing.

00:20:02.960 --> 00:20:04.800
To make sure you don't
accept Sachiko's rosary...

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:08.000
...to help her when you have
no interest in being her soeur,

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:11.970
if you accept and the role
of Cinderella becomes vacant,

00:20:11.970 --> 00:20:13.940
you'll be taking her place.

00:20:14.940 --> 00:20:18.470
The moment you accept the rosary,
you'll be Sachiko's soeur.

00:20:19.450 --> 00:20:21.680
It's the duty of the little sister to fill the hole...

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:23.150
...left by her big sister, right?

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:26.620
