Sachiko-sama and myself?

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:33.620
Why didn't you accept?

00:20:33.890 --> 00:20:35.460
If you'd become her little sister,

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:37.950
it would've been easier to negotiate
with Sachiko-sama, too.

